# Purpose: Pod exec와 Secret 접근·거부를 확인한다.
# Log group: /aws/eks/aws-topology-primary/cluster
# Normal: 승인된 운영자 활동만 존재
# Attack/abuse: 예상하지 않은 user·source IP·namespace의 요청
# False positive: Argo CD·Bootstrap·운영 점검
# Runtime verification: 2026-08-02; 44 rows were 43 Secret watch + 1 list, all status 200 from Kubernetes/Argo system actors. Pod exec 0. Treat as baseline, not an attack.
fields @timestamp, verb, user.username, sourceIPs.0,
       objectRef.namespace, objectRef.resource, objectRef.subresource,
       objectRef.name, responseStatus.code
| filter (
    objectRef.resource = "pods" and objectRef.subresource = "exec"
  ) or objectRef.resource = "secrets"
| sort @timestamp desc
| limit 200
